The [[Blood Goobert]] is a neutral [[Pet]] normally obtained by combining a [[Goobert]] with a [[Blood Amulet]]. It grants a bunch of {{icon/vampirism}} at start of battle, more than twice what the [[Blood Amulet]] gives, and deals {{icon/vampirism}}-scaling effect damage with lifesteal every few activations of the items on its sides.

It can be expected to do '''substantially''' more healing than the required [[Goobert]], with the added upside of dealing some moderate damage, or possibly even massive damage if {{icon/vampirism}} is high enough.

'''Blood Goobert''' can deal critical damage from having critical hit chance. Some items that give critical hit chance are [[Ranger Bag]] and [[Acorn Collar]]. The amount of health regenerated will be equal to the amount of damage dealt.

The [[Blood Goobert]], along with the [[Steel Goobert]] and [[Light Goobert]], is part of every "Rainbow" goobert craft.

